@startuml pkm-des-registration-form-sequence
autonumber
actor "User (Student/Admin)" as User
participant "Browser" as Browser
participant "Next.js Page" as Page
participant "Supabase Client" as Supabase
participant "Print Component" as PrintComp
database "PostgreSQL" as DB

User -> Browser : Navigates to Draft Registration Form
Browser -> Page : GET /student/cor or /admin/.../registration
Page -> Supabase : Queries enrollments (status=APPROVED)
Supabase -> DB : Select enrollment\nJOIN students, profiles, programs,\nenrollment_subjects, subjects

note right of DB: RLS enforces access rules:\nAdmin sees all,\nStudent sees only their own.

DB --> Supabase : Structured Data
Supabase --> Page : Enrollment Record with Attached Subjects

Page -> Page : Validates data and maps to presentation
Page -> PrintComp : Renders <RegistrationForm />
PrintComp --> Browser : HTML/CSS
Browser -> User : Displays Browser-Print Draft Registration Form
User -> Browser : Uses browser print dialog (Ctrl+P / Cmd+P)

@enduml
